  are licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0: non-commercial, share-alike, attribution required.
  They are used only to build weak labels for coursework and are not redistributed here.
  Any sample rows committed under data/samples/ are truncated excerpts kept under the
  same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 terms. The dataset's Apply/Avoid ratings and listing-gain
  targets are never used.

  configs/hedges.yaml counts a small subset of single words from the Loughran-McDonald
  uncertainty category. The dictionary itself is not redistributed.

Fine-tuned weights
